<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 351 0 R
/E (Color is hierarchical, not decorative. Three categories, dominant, supporting, accent, work together to create depth without noise. The 60-30-10 ratio is the baseline; individual layouts may shift slightly but never invert the hierarchy.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
